WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,573
Oops

2
00:00:00,573 --> 00:00:03,152
The men in the Dragon Kingdom are not big.

3
00:00:03,152 --> 00:00:06,303
Each tone is louder than the other.

4
00:00:06,303 --> 00:00:12,320
One person wants to challenge all the top jade ghosts in our Great Sakura Empire

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:19,640
It's so funny. Even in my dreams, I would never dare to have such an arrogant dream.

6
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:27,640
Qin Shan, take care of this Baoan and don’t let him talk nonsense anymore. We Dragon Kingdom people can die, but we must not be insulted.

7
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,640
Senior, you are really confident that you can deal with these people in Sakura Country

8
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,640
My service is appreciated
